# 🎬 mov-cli

A terminal-based movie search and streaming tool inspired by [ani-cli](https://github.com/pystardust/ani-cli). Search for movies, pick one, and stream it — all from the command line.

**No API keys required.** Searches IMDb directly and streams via VidSrc.

---

## Features

- **Search** movies by scraping [IMDb](https://www.imdb.com/) — no API key needed
- **Rich CLI** with colored tables, spinners, and error panels
- **Stream** directly in [IINA](https://iina.io/) via VidSrc
- **Dual search** — suggestion API with BeautifulSoup scrape fallback
- **Modular** codebase, ready for extensions (TV shows, subtitles, providers)

## Prerequisites

| Dependency  | Install                               |
| ----------- | ------------------------------------- |
| Python 3.9+ | [python.org](https://www.python.org/) |
| IINA        | `brew install --cask iina`            |

## Installation

```bash
# Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/mov-cli/mov-cli.git
cd mov-cli

# Install in editable mode
pip install -e .
```

## Usage

```bash
mov-cli <movie name>
```

### Example

```
$ mov-cli interstellar

 🎬 Search Results
┌──────┬──────────────────────────────┬──────┬─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│    # │ Title                        │ Year │ Cast                                    │
├──────┼──────────────────────────────┼──────┼─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│    1 │ Interstellar                 │ 2014 │ Matthew McConaughey, Anne Hathaway      │
│    2 │ Interstellar Wars            │ 2016 │ ...                                     │
└──────┴──────────────────────────────┴──────┴─────────────────────────────────────────┘

Select movie (number): 1

✓  Selected: Interstellar (2014)  IMDb: tt0816692

▶  Opening stream in IINA...
   https://vidsrc.icu/embed/movie?imdb=tt0816692
```

## Project Structure

```
mov-cli/
├── mov_cli/
│   ├── __init__.py       # Package version
│   ├── cli.py            # Argument parsing & user interaction
│   ├── imdb_search.py    # IMDb search (suggestion API + scrape fallback)
│   ├── stream.py         # VidSrc URL builder (IMDb ID based)
│   ├── player.py         # IINA launcher
│   └── utils.py          # Config, constants & helpers
├── main.py               # Standalone entry point
├── setup.py              # Package setup
├── requirements.txt      # Dependencies
└── README.md
```

## How It Works

```
User types movie name
        ↓
IMDb suggestion API search (+ scrape fallback)
        ↓
Select movie interactively
        ↓
Generate VidSrc URL with IMDb ID
        ↓
Launch IINA
```

